    "innovation": "This paper argues that experts justify solar geoengineering research not by quantifying risk, but by enacting a norm of competence that transforms \u201cunknown unknowns\u201d into \u201cknown unknowns,\u201d reviving the epistemic virtue of \u201clearned ignorance.\u201d",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "GeoMIP",
